Hey, Pearl, don't worry!

261
00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:56.330
It's only a nosebleed, Pearl!

262
00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:58.960
Look, we know it's not a battle wound!

263
00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:00.750
So just keep calm, okay?!

264
00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:01.760
What's this?

265
00:15:01.760 --> 00:15:05.010
These people aren't just
mean; they're dangerous!

266
00:15:05.010 --> 00:15:07.760
