why everyone's freakin' out?

267
00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:09.720
They're worried about a nosebleed?

268
00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:14.480
Calm down!

269
00:15:14.480 --> 00:15:17.650
It's just a nosebleed!
Don't lose your cool! Relax!

270
00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:22.690
Geez... What is that guy doing?!

271
00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:28.370
Danger...! Danger...! Danger!

272
00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:33.080
Oh no! It's started!

273
00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:36.710
When he gets upset, he catches fire!

274
00:15:36.710 --> 00:15:38.880
Uh... Wait, what?

275
00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:46.010
Fire Pearls... Special... Treat!

276
00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:54.640
